WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.129
My shop, live — three quote requests came in overnight.

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:08.257
Twelve wheel bearings for Northfield Aero, quoted in the browser: quantity, steel, finish.

00:00:08.257 --> 00:00:12.386
The price recomputes as I drag.

00:00:12.386 --> 00:00:16.514
Quote sent.

00:00:16.514 --> 00:00:20.643
The honesty gate refuses a non-manifold file — nothing fabricated, and that yellow card is the point.

00:00:20.643 --> 00:00:24.771
A good file passes DFM; the STEP downloads with its hash.

00:00:24.771 --> 00:00:28.900
Electrical: volts and amps in, breaker and wire size out.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:38.900
Ten seconds of the part itself — this is what the shop makes.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:44.067
Two orders won.

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:49.233
Revenue moves, win rate moves, break-even moves with it.

00:00:49.233 --> 00:00:54.400
Inbox to quote to order, every feature, one key — open a shop from chat, and run it from here.
